                                 <p class="oj-ti-grseq-1" id="d1e2663-1-1">3.   <span class="oj-sp-normal">AI technology-specific codes</span>
                                 </p>
                                 <p class="oj-ti-grseq-1" id="d1e2672-1-1">a.   <span class="oj-sp-normal">Symbolic AI and expert systems</span>
                                 </p>
                                 <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="oj-table">
                                    <col width="38%"/>
                                    <col width="63%"/>
